{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜已故警員朱振國舉行最高榮譽喪禮／屯門醫院神經醫學中心開幕\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DAIRY-261023.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】警方今日(10月23日)為已故警員朱振國舉行最高榮譽喪禮，將會安葬浩園。同日，屯門醫院神經醫學中心開幕，推動跨專科治療腦神經疾病，醫務衞生局局長盧寵茂將出席儀式。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T00:19:48.336722+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T23:24:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T21:58:31.810887+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T00:18:09.398590+00:00","content_hash":"0898b902309970b93909a1e658392c88467e9e36bc115a2d593875a50a9562a0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}